From 38505df48e75e0daac175e7a04c35f95e95f41f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4pp4
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:44:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Use the thumbnail factory of Nemo

The scope generates thumbnails only with totem-video-thumbnailer, which
is not installed without Totem, and stores them in its own cache.
Generate the thumbnails with the thumbnail factory of cinnamon-desktop
(used by Nemo) in a background thread instead. The factory uses any
installed thumbnailer (e.g. ffmpegthumbnailer or Totem) and stores the
thumbnails in the shared thumbnail cache, so the scope and Nemo use
each other's thumbnails. Failed thumbnails are recorded and not
generated again.

Signed-off-by: c4pp4
